Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.81,0:00:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《Astral：第107号Numbers的出现》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.07,0:00:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《当2个银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.55,0:00:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}齐聚之时所感受到的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.57,0:00:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}某种非同寻常的东西…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.87,0:00:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一位银河眼使用者 米扎艾尔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙就是 巴利安的真面目…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们终于也动真格了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.07,0:00:40.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马啊… 现在的你身心都受了伤。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而我也是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.76,0:00:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕是巴利安使用的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}球体力场的影响吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到了需要在皇之钥中休息的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.23,0:00:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 仅仅是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的迷惘 恐惧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.42,0:00:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.02,0:01:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就像能亲手触摸到一样传达过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.61,0:01:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然你也在痛苦，但你想要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.77,0:01:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}保护我的这份心意，让我很开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 光是这样是不行的》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马：我明明必须
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.43,0:01:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}保护好星光体才行……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.69,0:01:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明决定了绝对要保护他的……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.73,0:01:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可我却……》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.97,0:03:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）真是的，你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.23,0:03:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跑去决斗庵玩得太嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.81,0:03:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从悬崖上掉下去是怎么回事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.93,0:03:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且…… 呃，是叫凌牙君吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然连朋友都卷进来了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底是有多笨手笨脚啊！
Comment: 0,0:03:19.29,0:03:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《小鸟：就说成是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.79,0:03:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么回事比较好{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐是这么说的》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.41,0:03:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还好没骨折算是万幸了……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）那个，不好意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:31.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)现在哥哥刚休息下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以的话，请再安静一点……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.03,0:03:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对、对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.76,0:03:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 我去上班了要乖乖待着哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听到了没！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.99,0:03:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯、嗯……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.93,0:03:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)游马君的姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然是那么可怕的人……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.99,0:03:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)胆子都吓缩了呀。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.85,0:03:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)那样的话 找媳妇可就费劲了啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.69,0:03:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)可不是嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.09,0:03:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)大家 说到底不安静点可不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 不行啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.60,0:04:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请不用担心。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.05,0:04:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那是骗人的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐也虽然是因为担心才这么做的吧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.01,0:04:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但总觉得有点可怜。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}懂得体贴人心的璃绪小姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.17,0:04:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 璃绪！把窗帘关上。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.27,0:04:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到隔壁那个磨磨蹭蹭的混蛋就让人恶心。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切！真让人火大！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（米迦勒）怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站不起来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.87,0:04:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就这样满身屈辱地沉睡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.83,0:05:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}歼灭的螺旋·尖刺！））
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.15,0:05:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是梦啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 我……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.21,0:05:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每天晚上 每天晚上 都用那没出息的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.27,0:05:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做噩梦呻吟个不停。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.18,0:05:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说 到底怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}摆着那么一张阴沉的脸。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}平时的你这家伙明明……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.40,0:05:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们俩知道现在几点了嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(哈鲁特)不行啊 哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.89,0:05:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}朋友住院了就得去探望才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.75,0:05:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.12,0:05:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥要是不去的话那我去。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.74,0:05:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)站住你打算去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.55,0:05:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然是去探望游马啊这还用说嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.88,0:05:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奥比塔尔7)凯特大人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.47,0:05:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差不多到了之前预定{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.85,0:05:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去探望的时间了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.26,0:05:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然凯特大人 为了笨蛋游马那种家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.31,0:05:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去探望什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.01,0:05:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}实在是浪费。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:05:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的话 已经没事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}年轻的孩子恢复得就是快，真好啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 都怪那个磨磨蹭蹭的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.34,0:06:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}害我一直积攒压力啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.09,0:06:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)“皇之钥我收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.43,0:06:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想要我还给你的话就来跟我决斗吧。
Comment: 0,0:06:36.36,0:06:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.89,0:06:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在天台等着”。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.16,0:06:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太慢了 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.47,0:06:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.31,0:06:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 你会拿着皇之钥？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么为什么，哪有那么多废话。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想要我还回这东西的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用决斗把我打趴下试试。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.67,0:07:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[扬声器]AR影像 链接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.98,0:07:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.58,0:07:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将怪兽以里侧守备表示设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.74,0:07:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我盖下的是 隆隆隆石人。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.93,0:07:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先用这家伙探探情况》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样结束回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？ 这就结束了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底想不想赢啊 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.69,0:07:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 我这次的战 战…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连战术都说不利索。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少在那胡说八道！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然就你一个人的话 根本不够看。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和星光体一起放马过来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.13,0:08:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.23,0:08:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.09,0:08:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体不出来吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.51,0:08:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来他对你那副怂样已经彻底失望了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 鱼卵。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡通过支付1000生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将２只鱼卵衍生物\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.63,0:08:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将２只鱼卵衍生物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.33,0:08:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升级召唤等级９的大鲸鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.70,0:08:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张怪兽召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.65,0:09:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上的所有里侧守备怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为表侧表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.09,0:09:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大翻浪！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.45,0:09:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，根据大鲸鱼的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.05,0:09:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将１只等级４以下的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，钻头海胆！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.09,0:09:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后发动魔法卡 三·切。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.99,0:09:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.90,0:09:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级9的大·鲸鱼送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个等级除以3的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性怪兽3体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 3体的星鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.64,0:09:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这难道是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.31,0:09:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今 别大惊小怪了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.67,0:09:48.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级3的星鱼2体
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.98,0:09:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2体的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.73,0:09:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.70,0:09:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从深邃的水底浮上来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}潜航母舰 航空鲨。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 用等级3的钻头·藤壶和
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星鱼叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还要再叫1体吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.31,0:10:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自漆黑之暗现身吧，赤红之枪。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.85,0:10:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}黑・光・{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}枪{\fnYusei Magic}兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超越竟然有2只？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.01,0:10:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了，游马发动气旋鲨鱼的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.89,0:10:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.89,0:10:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1张自己的手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.51,0:10:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就造成400点伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的手牌是2张。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.38,0:10:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此，是800点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.09,0:10:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}空气龙卷！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.01,0:10:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}接着，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}发动{\fnYusei Magic}黑・光・{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}枪{\fnYusei Magic}兵的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:11:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将隆隆隆石人的效果无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天堂长枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.63,0:11:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.16,0:11:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，你的隆隆隆石人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被破坏掉的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.19,0:11:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大食者！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}趁它变得毫无防备给你来一发狠的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.10,0:11:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}黑・雷・{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}枪{\fnYusei Magic}兵\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对游马直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑枪刺击！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之就先陪你玩到这儿吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.29,0:11:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，轮到你了。别在那儿悠哉地睡大觉啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.36,0:11:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的……我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:11:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《鲨鱼场上有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.51,0:11:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两只超量怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我这边场上空空如也》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.05,0:12:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌召唤隆隆隆巨人。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.74,0:12:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？总算有点干劲了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.52,0:12:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《轰轰轰巨人的攻击力是2000。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力1900的空气鲨虽然能打倒{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:26.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但攻击力2100的黑雷枪兵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.97,0:12:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是打不倒的》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.49,0:12:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 这里就…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动轰轰轰巨人的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张怪兽召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从自己的墓地选1只轰轰轰魔像
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.33,0:12:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 这个效果发动时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.22,0:12:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轰轰轰巨人变为守备表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.59,0:12:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.11,0:12:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续魔法 轰轰轰护符！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡的效果 轰轰轰怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.26,0:12:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会被战斗破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.68,0:12:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 当轰轰轰怪兽有2只以上时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.24,0:13:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对玩家造成的效果伤害也无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.85,0:13:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！ 这样一来 空气鲨的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}空气鸟已经被我封住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这就 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.11,0:13:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是在小看我吗 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的你 就是个胆小的丧家犬！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.56,0:13:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连战斗勇气都没有的家伙根本抓不住胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 从今往后我们的面前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.96,0:13:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会比以往更强大的敌人挡在我们的路上吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 希望你察觉到。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今后 我和你需要的东西究竟是什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.55,0:13:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.53,0:13:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤等级５的豹鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.67,0:13:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽 在对方场上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.79,0:13:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有２只以上怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.69,0:13:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以不用解放召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.81,0:13:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 豹鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:13:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 豹鲨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在场上的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌把这家伙特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.75,0:14:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 鹰鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级5的豹鲨和
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鹰鲨叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.55,0:14:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.37,0:14:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大海啊 撕裂吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凶猛无比的 鲨鱼巢穴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.86,0:14:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 鲨鱼要塞！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.14,0:14:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第3只怪兽超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 接下来才是正戏！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.79,0:14:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我给 黑鳍枪兵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备魔法 鲨鱼冰锥！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.77,0:14:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了这张卡的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.61,0:14:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}视为鲨鱼怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升400点。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我使用1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑·鲨…… 不
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.71,0:15:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑·鲨·枪兵的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.89,0:15:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使1只怪兽的效果无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 五五五五巨像的效果就无效了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.78,0:15:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你那软弱的灵魂就让我来帮你敲打修正！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.09,0:15:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}空气鲨 攻击五五五巨人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.91,0:15:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续魔法 五五五护符的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次使战斗造成的破坏无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 第2发！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用黑·鲨·枪兵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.03,0:15:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击五五五巨人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.60,0:15:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来是第3发。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.24,0:15:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧 用鲨鱼·堡垒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.30,0:15:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击五五五五巨像！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.65,0:15:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}五五五护符的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.94,0:16:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（五五五五巨像）五五五。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.93,0:16:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}勉 勉强 撑过去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}撑过去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.94,0:16:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别逗我笑了。我的真本事 现在才开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.23,0:16:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动鲨鱼要塞的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.96,0:16:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.89,0:16:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把1个超量素材取除{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.22,0:16:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让鲨鱼要塞以外的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼怪兽的攻击次数增加1次。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择 空气鲨。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.72,0:16:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来空气鲨就能再攻击一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}牙之重装！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.07,0:16:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}空气鲨 攻击隆隆隆石人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为场上的隆隆隆怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.36,0:16:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.77,0:16:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隆隆隆护符被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再来一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.63,0:17:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动鲨鱼要塞的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.43,0:17:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把1个超量素材取除
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.55,0:17:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让怪兽再攻击一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.35,0:17:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择黑鲨枪兵。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.75,0:17:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}翻车鱼装填！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用黑鲨枪兵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.45,0:17:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对游马直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.59,0:17:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《就这样……就这样结束了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样什么都做不到就要输了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.69,0:17:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}像那时候一样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.36,0:17:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连重要的东西都保护不了就要结束了吗》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.95,0:17:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《不要啊 我想走得更远。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.83,0:17:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 和那家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.13,0:17:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和星光体一起决斗！》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.44,0:18:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.87,0:18:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想更多地和星光体一起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗下去啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我一直在等这句话。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.14,0:18:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既不是我来救你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.52,0:18:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也不是你来保护我。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和你，要一起战斗下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.77,0:18:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，是嘎嘎嘎嘎守护者！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.14,0:18:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.57,0:18:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.89,0:18:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手牌特殊召唤嘎嘎嘎嘎守护者！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎嘎嘎嘎守护者
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在受到直接攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.56,0:18:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以以攻击表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.23,0:18:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，通过丢弃1张手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.62,0:18:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以让这只怪兽在战斗中的破坏无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.75,0:18:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算避开了怪兽的破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.45,0:18:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害你也得给我吃下！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.37,0:18:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样结束回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.77,0:19:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，站起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，不管多少次我都会站起来给你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与共同战斗的同伴一起为了开辟未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.05,0:19:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.65,0:19:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.63,0:19:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，胜利的方程式已经完成了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.09,0:19:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.59,0:19:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌召唤 我我我骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的 我我我守卫者和
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.17,0:19:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我骑士 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.60,0:19:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.74,0:19:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身披光芒现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.05,0:19:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}劈开黑暗的 耀眼王者
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.72,0:19:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}英豪冠军 断钢剑王！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.78,0:19:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于来了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动装备魔法 最强之盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.21,0:20:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了这张卡的战士族怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在攻击表示时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.27,0:20:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将守备力加到攻击力上。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}艾克斯卡利巴的守备力是2000
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.33,0:20:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此攻击力是4000。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.74,0:20:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力4000。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.53,0:20:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但光是这样可削不掉我的生命值啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我还要发动艾克斯卡利巴的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.00,0:20:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过把所有超量素材都用掉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.31,0:20:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗期间 攻击力变成两倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.45,0:20:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.42,0:20:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾吧 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.45,0:20:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用艾克斯卡利巴攻击鲨鱼要塞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.17,0:20:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必杀的一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《嘿 这不是挺能干的嘛》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.11,0:21:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.62,0:21:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧 鲨鱼？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.45,0:21:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 游马能重新振作起来都是多亏了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.61,0:21:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我来向你道谢吧谢谢你。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.54,0:21:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊 我可没有被你道谢的道理。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.32,0:21:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 你在这场决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从一开始就是抱着这个打算的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.65,0:21:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋 才不是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.83,0:21:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨 鲨鱼… 你这家伙真是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.26,0:21:41.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛 自己一个人感动个什么劲啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.78,0:21:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这种地方让人烦啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《观察结果 其22。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.37,0:21:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人类有时会不
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.43,0:21:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}坦率地表达自己的心情》
Comment: 0,0:21:52.17,0:22:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.20,0:22:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《话说回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.36,0:22:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伙伴 真是好东西啊》
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.52,0:23:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.36,0:23:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.65,0:23:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.56,0:23:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.24,0:23:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.98,0:23:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
